# brandnana — brief

Turn gathered signal into a creative brief, or kick off the full brief-generation pipeline for a domain.

app :brandnana__brief do
  title       "brandnana — brief"
  description "Turn gathered signal into a creative brief, or kick off the full brief-generation pipeline for a domain."
end

## Common verbs

```bash
brandnana brief <domain>                      # get the brief for a domain
brandnana brief <domain> --handle <handle>    # override the social handle
brandnana brief generate <domain>             # run the generation pipeline
brandnana brief generate <domain> --competitors a.com,b.com
brandnana brief generate <domain> --with-video --link-only --force
brandnana brief generate <domain> --out ./dir # write to a dir instead of installing
```

`brief <domain>` defaults the social handle to the second-level domain; override with `--handle` when they differ. `brief generate` shares flags with `book` (`--competitors`, `--with-video`, `--link-only`, `--force`).

## What "good" looks like

- Feed the brief real evidence (ads + social + catalog), not priors.
- `--out` for an inspectable artifact; omit it to install as a skill.

## Common pitfalls

- Generating a brief before gathering signal — it'll be generic.

